Question: A company plans to produce three products A_{1}, A_{2}, A_{3}. It can produce for 22 days in a month. The 36-1.csv file gives the maximum demand (in units of 100 kg), prices ($/100 kg), production costs (per 100 kg of product), and production quotas (the maximum number of units of 100 kg of product that can be produced in a day if all production lines are dedicated to that product).

